# OMG (Oh My GitHub) agent instructions

Do not implement, suggest, report, or propose security issues unless the user explicitly asks for a security review.
Inspect the OpenCode implementation at `/Users/igor/Documents/ChatGPT/opencode` and [anomalyco/opencode](https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode) for related requests.

## Wiki index

- [OpenCode workflow](wiki/opencode.md)
- [Test OpenCode execution](wiki/opencode-v2-experiment.md)
- [Oh My Github App](https://github.com/denaidark/omsite/blob/main/wiki/oh-my-github-app.md)
- [Temporary Mac SSH access](wiki/access.md)
- [Testing and verification](wiki/testing.md)
- [OmGithub publishing](https://github.com/denaidark/omsite/blob/main/wiki/omgithub.md)


## Main project file

The main project file is [.github/workflows/opencode.yml](.github/workflows/opencode.yml).

Keep the local [game issue E2E skill](.agents/skills/game-issue-e2e/SKILL.md)
aligned with this workflow. Create an issue with `OpenCode` and only user-requested mode labels already attached, to start the native `issues.opened` listener. Wait only for the
initial OpenCode session link during E2E kickoff. Install the listener on the
default branch before requesting execution. Validate author access and freeze
the request inside Actions before starting the reusable execution job.
Set repository variable `OPENCODE_ACCESS=everyone` to accept any issue author
for labeled issues. Keep the App as a setup
helper. Use Actions concurrency to serialize each issue.
Store `branch` in an `omgithub-request:v1` JSON HTML comment to select the
project checkout, result base, and workflow. Let default-branch preparation
dispatch the selected branch. Run preparation and OpenCode in that branch run.

## Shell timing

When writing shell scripts,
always add explicit per-command execution-time measurements between commands.
Use `/usr/bin/time -p` or a small timing helper around each meaningful command;
the outer command duration is not sufficient because it hides which step is
slow or hung. Use `/usr/bin/time` only in scripts; do not invoke it directly in
interactive shell commands.

## Ideas

Store durable implementation ideas as individual Markdown files under
`./ideas/`, using descriptive kebab-case filenames such as
`ideas/opencode-oauth-env-auth.md`.




## Links in handoffs

When a relevant URL or stable identifier exists, include a clickable Markdown
link in the user-facing response. Link GitHub issues, Actions runs, pull
requests, commits, releases, public app URLs, and Codex tasks/threads rather
than reporting only their numbers or plain text. For Codex tasks/threads, use
the `codex://threads/<thread-id>` URL format.

When mentioning a commit, append its relative age in hours or days.

## OpenCode GitHub Actions

To execute an issue, create it with `OpenCode` and only mode labels explicitly requested by the user.
Check for a native `issues` run and successful preparation.
The workflow starts a temporary AgentsWeb SSH session,
verifies it, runs OpenCode, and cleans up the SSH session afterward.

When monitoring a triggered run, use `gh run watch <run-id> --repo denaidark/OhMyGithub --exit-status` for overall job status.
Do not use `gh run view --log` to read logs from a running task: GitHub reports that
logs are unavailable until completion. Use `bash scripts/ssh-run-log.sh <run-id>`
for the live Actions log over SSH. Do not use tight `for` loops around `gh run list`,
which needlessly consume GitHub API rate limit.

Free OpenCode models are limited per egress IP, not per account.
Treat a local `FreeUsageLimitError` 429 as local only.
Read the runner's own `Selected model` and provider errors before blaming quota.
Use `retryAfterMs` as the reset bound.
Run repeated V2 tests with a connected provider; do not spend the free allowance on retries.

Interrupting a V2 turn before the assistant message projects leaves no stopped message to save.
Wait for that assistant message before requiring the interrupted idle marker.

To connect to an issue's live worker, find its run ID with
`gh run list --repo denaidark/OhMyGithub --workflow opencode.yml --status in_progress`,
then run `bash scripts/ssh-run-log.sh <run-id>` to discover the host and port and SSH
with `~/.ssh/aiplay-agentsweb` as shown by the helper.

When the user asks to check a live OpenCode workflow, always pull the runner logs
over SSH first, using `scripts/ssh-run-log.sh` or a targeted SSH read from the
same runner. Base the answer on those logs before discussing whether an action
is confirmed; do not lead with a generic inability-to-confirm statement when
live log evidence can be collected.

For real-time inspection from a live temporary SSH session, use the helper:

```sh
bash scripts/ssh-run-log.sh <run-id>
```

The helper discovers the temporary SSH command from the triggering issue or pull
request, then follows the freshest `_diag/pages` log. The runner uploads chunks from
`_diag/blocks` to GitHub. Do not print environment files, tokens, or private keys while
inspecting the runner.

## Mac SSH access

The Mac private key stays at `~/.ssh/aiplay-agentsweb`. Its public key is
stored in the repository Actions secret `AGENTSWEB_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY`. The issue
commented by the workflow contains a directly usable command such as:

```sh
ssh -i ~/.ssh/aiplay-agentsweb -p <port> runner@<run-name>.agentsweb.space
```

The command works only while the corresponding Actions job is running.

## Connecting to a live OpenCode worker

Use the repository helper to discover the worker host and port from the broker
or issue comment. It uses the persistent local key `~/.ssh/aiplay-agentsweb`:

```sh
bash scripts/ssh-run-log.sh <run-id> --repo denaidark/OhMyGithub
```

For an interactive shell, reuse the host and port printed by the helper and
use the same key:

```sh
ssh -tt -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no \
  -o UserKnownHostsFile=/dev/null \
  -i ~/.ssh/aiplay-agentsweb \
  -p <port> runner@<run-name>.agentsweb.space
```

Do not substitute the generated runner key under `sshworker/outputs/keys/`; it
can produce a misleading `Permission denied (publickey)` result. Temporary
worker SSH access ends when the Actions job and session are cleaned up. Never
print secrets while inspecting a worker.

input.content:
:root {
  --ink: #07080b;
  --paper: #f3ead8;
  --red: #ff2e3e;
  --red-deep: #b3091a;
  --cyan: #55e7ff;
  --amber: #ffb347;
  --green: #74ffb0;
  --ui: "Arial Narrow", "Roboto Condensed", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif;
  --display: Impact, Haettenschweiler, "Arial Black", sans-serif;
  --mono: "Courier New", "Lucida Console", monospace;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #050609;
  color: var(--paper);
  font-family: var(--ui);
  overscroll-behavior: none;
}

body {
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

#app {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #050609;
}

#game {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  outline: none;
  touch-action: none;
}

/* ---------- screen texture ---------- */
#vignette,
#scanlines,
#grain,
#chroma,
#cinema-bars,
#damageFlash {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}

#vignette {
  z-index: 3;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 44%, transparent 34%, rgba(2, 3, 6, .34) 72%, rgba(0, 0, 0, .86) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 8, 14, .2), transparent 22%, transparent 80%, rgba(0, 0, 0, .32));
}

#scanlines {
  z-index: 4;
  opacity: .12;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0, transparent 2px, rgba(0, 0, 0, .55) 3px, transparent 4px);
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}

#grain {
  z-index: 5;
  opacity: .09;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 180 180' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='.75'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  background-size: 180px 180px;
  animation: grainShift .24s steps(2) infinite;
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
}

@keyframes grainShift {
  0% { transform: translate(0, 0) }
  25% { transform: translate(-2%, 1%) }
  50% { transform: translate(1%, -2%) }
  75% { transform: translate(2%, 2%) }
  100% { transform: translate(-1%, -1%) }
}

#chroma {
  z-index: 6;
  opacity: .16;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 50, .1), transparent 5%, transparent 95%, rgba(0, 220, 255, .1));
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
}

#cinema-bars span {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 10px;
  background: #010102;
  z-index: 8;
}
#cinema-bars span:first-child { top: 0; }
#cinema-bars span:last-child { bottom: 0; }

#damageFlash {
  z-index: 7;
  opacity: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 30%, rgba(180, 0, 20, .54) 80%, rgba(80, 0, 8, .8)),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 20, 20, .2), transparent 30%, transparent 70%, rgba(255, 20, 20, .2));
  transition: opacity .2s ease;
}
#damageFlash.hit { opacity: 1; transition: opacity .04s ease; }

/* ---------- HUD shared ---------- */
.is-hidden { display: none !important; }

#hud {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 10;
  pointer-events: none;
  font-family: var(--ui);
  letter-spacing: .06em;
}

.brand-block {
  position: absolute;
  top: max(24px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
  left: max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, .65));
}
.brand-lockup { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; }
.brand-hawkins {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.15vw, 46px);
  line-height: .8;
  letter-spacing: .035em;
  color: #f6eedf;
  text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 46, 62, .1), 2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .7);
}
.brand-year {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--red);
  border-top: 2px solid var(--red);
  padding-top: 2px;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
}
.brand-sub {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: .18em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .66);
}
.live-dot {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--red);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--red);
  animation: blink 1.6s steps(2) infinite;
}
@keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: .22; } }

.top-right-status {
  position: absolute;
  top: max(24px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
  right: max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
  width: 176px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.signal {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .5);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}
.signal b { color: var(--red); font-weight: 400; }
.signal-bar {
  width: 14px;
  height: 7px;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);
  opacity: .8;
}
.dimension {
  width: 100%;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 7px;
  letter-spacing: .16em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .5);
}
.dimension .meter {
  height: 3px;
  margin-top: 5px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
  overflow: hidden;
}
#breachFill {
  display: block;
  width: 22%;
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--amber), var(--red));
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--red);
  transition: width .8s ease;
}
.icon-btn {
  pointer-events: auto;
  appearance: none;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  padding: 2px 0;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  letter-spacing: .13em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .55);
  cursor: pointer;
}
.icon-btn:hover { color: var(--cyan); }

/* ---------- mission card ---------- */
.mission-panel {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20.5%;
  left: max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
  width: min(322px, 35vw);
  padding: 14px 17px 13px 16px;
  background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(5, 7, 11, .83), rgba(5, 7, 11, .45) 72%, transparent);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--red);
  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px #000;
  transform: skewX(-1.5deg);
}
.mission-panel::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 16px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--red);
  box-shadow: 64px 0 0 rgba(255, 46, 62, .45);
}
.case-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
#caseNo {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  color: var(--red);
}
.case-rule { height: 1px; flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 46, 62, .5), transparent); }
.mission-title {
  margin-top: 7px;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(20px, 2.25vw, 30px);
  line-height: .94;
  letter-spacing: .025em;
  color: #fff9ec;
}
.mission-desc {
  margin-top: 6px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .74);
  max-width: 275px;
}
.mission-meta {
  margin-top: 9px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 7px;
  letter-spacing: .12em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .46);
}
.mission-meta span:nth-child(2) { color: var(--amber); }
.mission-meta span:nth-child(3) { margin-left: auto; color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .28); }
.objective-pip {
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  background: var(--amber);
  transform: rotate(45deg);
  box-shadow: 0 0 7px var(--amber);
}

/* ---------- vitals ---------- */
.vitals {
  position: absolute;
  left: max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
  bottom: max(39px, calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 20px));
  width: 220px;
}
.vital-label {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  letter-spacing: .16em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .52);
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}
#healthText { color: #f3ead8; }
.health-track {
  position: relative;
  height: 9px;
  background: rgba(10, 12, 15, .68);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .15);
  overflow: hidden;
}
#healthFill {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #64f8a8, #c4ffc4);
  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(100, 248, 168, .4);
  transition: width .2s ease, background .25s ease;
}
#healthFill.low { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff253c, #ff7062); box-shadow: 0 0 13px rgba(255, 37, 60, .55); }
.health-ticks {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 21px, rgba(0, 0, 0, .34) 21px 22px);
}
.stamina-track {
  height: 2px;
  margin-top: 5px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
}
#staminaFill {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--cyan);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(85, 231, 255, .4);
}

/* ---------- minimap ---------- */
.minimap-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  left: max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-left));
  bottom: max(88px, calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 74px));
  width: 188px;
  height: 188px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(3, 5, 8, .85);
  border: 1px solid rgba(243, 234, 216, .2);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, .35), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, .55), 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .3);
  overflow: hidden;
}
#minimap { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; opacity: .94; }
.map-n {
  position: absolute;
  top: 7px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 7px;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .42);
}
.map-label {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 11px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 6px;
  letter-spacing: .2em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .5);
  text-shadow: 0 1px 4px #000;
}

/* ---------- car hud ---------- */
.car-hud {
  position: absolute;
  right: max(31px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
  bottom: max(48px, calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 24px));
  width: 230px;
  text-align: right;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 10px #000);
}
.speed-readout { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: baseline; gap: 7px; }
#speedValue {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 72px);
  line-height: .74;
  letter-spacing: -.01em;
  color: #fff8e8;
  text-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 46, 62, .22);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.speed-readout small { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--red); letter-spacing: .15em; }
.gear-line { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 6px; margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .46); }
#gearValue { color: var(--amber); }
.gear-rule { width: 22px; height: 1px; background: rgba(243, 234, 216, .26); }
.nitro-track { height: 3px; margin-top: 8px; margin-left: 62px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12); }
#nitroFill { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), var(--amber)); }

/* ---------- prompts / dialogue ---------- */
.interaction {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 20%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  padding: 8px 13px;
  background: rgba(5, 7, 10, .82);
  border: 1px solid rgba(243, 234, 216, .22);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9px;
  letter-spacing: .13em;
  color: #f6eedf;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
kbd {
  display: inline-block;
  min-width: 18px;
  padding: 2px 4px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(243, 234, 216, .45);
  border-radius: 2px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  line-height: 1.1;
  text-align: center;
  color: #fff;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06);
}
.interaction kbd { border-color: var(--red); color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }

.dialogue {
  pointer-events: auto;
  position: absolute;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: max(54px, calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 30px));
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: min(670px, 84vw);
  min-height: 72px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 15px;
  padding: 10px 16px 12px 10px;
  background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(5, 7, 11, .95), rgba(8, 10, 15, .86));
  border: 1px solid rgba(243, 234, 216, .2);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
  cursor: pointer;
}
.dialogue::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: -1px;
  top: 12px;
  bottom: 12px;
  width: 2px;
  background: var(--red);
}
.portrait {
  width: 55px;
  height: 60px;
  flex: 0 0 55px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 33px;
  color: #f2e7d3;
  background:
    linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(255, 46, 62, .2), transparent 60%),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 3px, rgba(255, 255, 255, .05) 3px 4px),
    #101217;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 46, 62, .45);
}
#speaker { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--red); letter-spacing: .2em; }
#line {
  margin: 5px 0 0;
  font-size: clamp(11px, 1.14vw, 14px);
  line-height: 1.44;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
  color: rgba(255, 250, 236, .9);
}
.dialogue-skip {
  position: absolute;
  right: 12px;
  bottom: 7px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 6px;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .3);
  letter-spacing: .14em;
}

.toasts {
  position: absolute;
  top: 24%;
  right: max(29px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
  width: min(340px, 35vw);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 8px;
}
.toast {
  position: relative;
  padding: 9px 13px;
  background: rgba(5, 7, 11, .8);
  border-right: 2px solid var(--amber);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  color: #fbf5e9;
  animation: toastIn .28s ease both;
  text-align: right;
}
.toast.red { border-color: var(--red); }
.toast.cyan { border-color: var(--cyan); }
.toast small { display: block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .16em; color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .5); margin-top: 3px; }
.toast.out { animation: toastOut .35s ease both; }
@keyframes toastIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(20px); } }
@keyframes toastOut { to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(15px); } }

/* ---------- controls strip / crosshair / boss ---------- */
.control-strip {
  position: absolute;
  right: max(29px, env(safe-area-inset-right));
  top: max(96px, calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 82px));
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 4px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 6px;
  letter-spacing: .13em;
  color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .37);
}
.control-strip span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
.control-strip kbd { min-width: 15px; padding: 1px 3px; font-size: 6px; border-color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .22); color: rgba(243, 234, 216, .68); }

.crosshair {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  opacity: .5;
  transition: opacity .12s;
}
.crosshair i, .crosshair b { position: absolute; background: rgba(255, 248, 230, .75); }
.crosshair i { left: 50%; top: 3px; bottom: 3px; width: 1px; transform: translateX(-50%); }
.crosshair b { top: 50%; left: 3px; right: 3px; height: 1px; transform: translateY(-50%); }
.crosshair::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 11px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 248, 230, .42); border-radius: 50%; }
.crosshair.locked { opacity: .95; }
.crosshair.locked::after { border-color: var(--red); box-shadow: 0 0 9px rgba(255, 46, 62, .6); }

.boss-bar {
  position: absolute;
  top: max(24px, env(safe-area-inset-top));
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: min(430px, 46vw);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  letter-spacing: .18em;
  color: var(--red);
  text-align: center;
}
.boss-bar div { height: 4px; margin-top: 6px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12); }
#bossFill { display: block; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red), #ff855e); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--red); transition: width .15s; }

/* ---------- title screen ---------- */
.title-screen {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 20;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: clamp(28px, 6vw, 92px);
  background:
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(3, 4, 7, .96) 0%, rgba(3, 4, 7, .83) 29%, rgba(3, 4, 7, .38) 55%, rgba(3, 4, 7, .08) 76%, rgba(3, 4, 7, .5) 100%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 68% 50%, rgba(120, 10, 20, .17), transparent 50%);
  transition: opacity .8s ease, visibility .8s;
}
.title-screen::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 119px, rgba(255, 255, 255, .018) 120px);
  mix-blend-mode: screen;
}
.title-screen.leaving { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
.title-copy {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  width: min(720px, 58vw);
  animation: titleRise 1s cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1) both;
}
@keyframes titleRise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); } }
.eyebrow {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  letter-spacing: .23em;
  color: var(--red);
}
.eyebrow i { display: inline-block; width: 26px; height: 1px; background: var(--red); box-shadow: 0 0 7px var(--red); }
.game-title {
  position: relative;
  margin: 15px 0 0;
  font-family: var(--display);
  line-height: .75;
  letter-spacing: -.02em;
  color: #f4ead7;
  text-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, .6);
}
.game-title .word {
  display: block;
  font-size: clamp(80px, 14.8vw, 214px);
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff7e6 0%, #d6c8b1 38%, #7c7060 40%, #f5ead4 47%, #a89a84 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 0 #1c0a0c) drop-shadow(0 0 22px rgba(255, 46, 62, .18));
}
.game-title .year {
